        "why": "The verses speak about how Paul made his plans, not about changing them.",
        "suggestion": "Paul did not make his plans carelessly"
      }
    },
    "2CO.1.19-20": {
      "text": "All God’s promises are made certain in Christ",
      "source": "ai:anthropic/claude-sonnet-5.5",
      "status": "ai-checked",
      "check": { "by": "ai:google/gemini-3.8-flash", "verdict": "agree" }
    },
    "2CO.1.21-22": {
      "text": "God makes Paul and the Corinthians firm in Christ",
      "source": "ai:anthropic/claude-sonnet-5.5",
      "status": "ai-checked",
      "check": { "by": "ai:google/gemini-3.8-flash", "verdict": "agree" }
    },
    "2CO.1.23-24": {
      "text": "Paul did not return to Corinth to spare the believers",
      "source": "ai:anthropic/claude-sonnet-5.5",
      "status": "ai-checked",
      "check": { "by": "ai:google/gemini-3.8-flash", "verdict": "agree" }
    },
    "2CO.2.1-2": {
      "text": "Paul decides not to make another painful visit",
      "source": "ai:anthropic/claude-sonnet-5.5",
      "status": "ai-checked",
      "check": { "by": "ai:google/gemini-3.8-flash", "verdict": "agree" }
    },
    "2CO.2.3-4": {
      "text": "Paul wrote in tears to show his love for the church",
      "source": "ai:anthropic/claude-sonnet-5.5",
      "status": "ai-checked",
      "check": { "by": "ai:google/gemini-3.8-flash", "verdict": "agree" }
    },
    "2CO.2.5-7": {
      "text": "Paul urges the church to forgive and comfort the man",
      "source": "ai:anthropic/claude-sonnet-5.5",
      "status": "ai-checked",
      "check": { "by": "ai:google/gemini-3.8-flash", "verdict": "agree" }
    },
    "2CO.2.8-9": {
      "text": "Paul asks the church to show love to the man again",
      "source": "ai:anthropic/claude-sonnet-5.5",
      "status": "ai-checked",
      "check": { "by": "ai:google/gemini-3.8-flash", "verdict": "agree" }
    },
    "2CO.2.10-11": {
      "text": "Paul forgives the man so Satan cannot outwit believers",
      "source": "ai:anthropic/claude-sonnet-5.5",
      "status": "ai-checked",
      "check": { "by": "ai:google/gemini-3.8-flash", "verdict": "agree" }
    },
    "2CO.2.12-13": {
      "text": "Paul has no peace in Troas and goes to Macedonia",
      "source": "ai:anthropic/claude-sonnet-5.5",
      "status": "ai-checked",
      "check": { "by": "ai:google/gemini-3.8-flash", "verdict": "agree" }
    },
    "2CO.2.14-15": {
      "text": "Paul thanks God for spreading the knowledge of Christ",
      "source": "ai:anthropic/claude-sonnet-5.5",
      "status": "ai-checked",
      "check": { "by": "ai:google/gemini-3.8-flash", "verdict": "agree" }
    },
    "2CO.2.16-17": {
      "text": "Paul speaks sincerely as a man sent from God",
      "source": "ai:anthropic/claude-sonnet-5.5",
      "status": "ai-checked",
      "check": { "by": "ai:google/gemini-3.8-flash", "verdict": "agree" }
    },
    "2CO.3.1-3": {
      "text": "The Corinthians are Christ’s letter written on hearts",
      "source": "ai:anthropic/claude-sonnet-5.5",
      "status": "ai-checked",
      "check": { "by": "ai:google/gemini-3.8-flash", "verdict": "agree" }
    },
    "2CO.3.4-6": {
      "text": "God makes Paul able to serve the new covenant",
